    <string name="onboarding_alias_title">Create your primary alias</string>
    <string name="onboarding_alias_body">An alias bundles your favorite voice, speed, and effect under a single name like \"narrator\". Marmalade uses the primary alias whenever an app asks it to speak without specifying a voice. Create at least one alias to finish setup — you can add more later from Settings → Voice aliases.</string>
